      "message": "\u003e the root certificate was the one with the debug mode, and debug is allowed for root certs if the profile has `allow_root_mode_debug\u003dtrue`.\n\nI see. In this case, could you just leave the root cert mode to be Debug in this file? This is a fake chain used for testing, I\u0027d prefer to keep one node in Debug actually if that\u0027s not in conflict with your change :)\n\nThe root cert of a pVM is controlled by SoC. It can be in debug mode. However, the pVM rialto uses a real DICE chain, it shouldn\u0027t be impacted by this cl as it only modifies the fake chain used in non-protected VM rialto.",
